@startuml F3.6-ERRO-sem-internship-review
title F3.6-ERRO — 403 sem internship.review
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "InternshipController" as Ctrl

Prof -> WebApp: /estagios?to=me
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /estagios?to=me
note right of Jwt
  internship.review ausente
  InternshipController não executa
end note
Jwt --> WebApp: 403
WebApp --> Prof: acesso negado

@enduml
